OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with clear spells Shetland
OL,7,Fat first. Outbreaks of rain and
OL,8,Fdrizzle spread northeast from the late
OL,9,Fevening, lingering in the early hours.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FCloudy with light rain and
OL,12,Fdrizzle in the morning. The rain will
OL,13,Fbecome persistent and heavy at times
OL,14,Fduring the afternoon.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,17,FShowers, frequent and heavy at times
OL,18,Fpush north Tuesday. These clear to
OL,19,Fleave Wednesday dry and bright for a
OL,20,Ftime. Outbreaks of rain, some heavy,
OL,21,FWednesday night turn showery Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
